SUMMARY:Rock Never Dies
LOCATION:Hard Rock Cafe - NYC
DESCRIPTION:Click HERE for all event datesFall in Love with Rock All Over A
 
gainInside the legendary Hard Rock Cafe in Times Square\, discover an exper
 
ience where music isnt just heard but felt.Rock Never Dies is a one-of-a-ki
 
nd immersive theatrical event from American Immersion Theater that is part 
 
concert\, part love story\, and fully a magical journey. This groundbreakin
 
g production invites you to dine\, drink\, and fall headfirst into the soul
 
 of rock and roll.Enjoy a full three-course meal inside the Magical Mystery
 
 Museum of Hard Rock\, a place where music has power\, memories come alive\
 
, and one life is changed forever every night. Its an experience that inspi
 
res you to keep dreaming and march to the beat of your own drum.At the hear
 
t of the story is Caroline\, a young artist whos lost hope and heart. As le
 
gendary music icons come to life around her\, shes forced to confront love\
 
, loss\, and the courage to take the stage again. Along the way\, you wont 
 
just watch the story\, but be part of it.Created by award-winning\, immersi
 
ve visionary Scott Cramton\, often called the Willy Wonka of Immersive Thea
 
ter\, this joyful\, high-energy spectacle blends iconic rock anthems with r
 
omance\, comedy\, and electrifying audience interaction.Whether youre on a 
 
date\, celebrating something special\, or just chasing that feeling music u
 
sed to give you\, this is your night.All it takesis one song\,one moment\,a
 
nd a second chanceto change everything. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketw
 
eb.com/event/rock-never-dies-hard-rock-cafe-tickets/15034613
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/rock-never-dies-hard-rock-cafe-tickets/
 
15034613
END:VEVENT
